{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unlikely group has been formed with the mission of defeating a new dark force corrupting the world. Maximilian, a beloved hero coming from a noble family, Liz, a legendary thief wanted in multiple countries and The Shadow, an enigmatic being that everyone thought was the origin of the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_1-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looting equipment will be your main task. Each piece is part of a set and equipping enough pieces of a set will unlock unique bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_6-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to acquire special skills from a tree that changes every game. Skills can offer you general utility, an increase in power or make one specific build go beyond its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_9-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each region a boss will try to stop you from completing your quest. This powerful enemies have special abilities and will test your strength, so make the right choices at every step of your journey to make sure no one will stand in your way!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410180?t=1749560690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410180?t=1749560690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/def4b05250422d37ca8ff2c1db30f95b0e928814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749560690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/def4b05250422d37ca8ff2c1db30f95b0e928814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749560690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3517160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unlikely group has been formed with the mission of defeating a new dark force corrupting the world. Maximilian, a beloved hero coming from a noble family, Liz, a legendary thief wanted in multiple countries and The Shadow, an enigmatic being that everyone thought was the origin of the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_1-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looting equipment will be your main task. Each piece is part of a set and equipping enough pieces of a set will unlock unique bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_6-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to acquire special skills from a tree that changes every game. Skills can offer you general utility, an increase in power or make one specific build go beyond its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/scene_9-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749560690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each region a boss will try to stop you from completing your quest. This powerful enemies have special abilities and will test your strength, so make the right choices at every step of your journey to make sure no one will stand in your way!</p>","developers":["Posing Possums"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/1577ab92ce6d69a0c3dc5d31471a38fb709e16f8/header.jpg?t=1749560690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257086227,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086227/movie480.mp4?t=1749418379","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086227/movie_max.mp4?t=1749418379"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086227/8772cfb25bde8877c708b393b160ba873146b660/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749418379","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086227/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749418379","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086227/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749418379"}}],"name":"Overlooting","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core  i3-3220<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 or AMD Radeon R7 240<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon R9 270<br></li><li><strong>Storag